// S-902 (spec §6.3: "`Hash` は上位の trait を持たない"; "`==` `!=` は `PartialEq` に絞る"): E0401 for `a == b` where `T: Hash`. `Hash`
// does not contain `PartialEq`, so the one candidate gives the bound `PartialEq` besides the `Hash`; no diagnostic is left after it.

pub fn same[T: Hash + PartialEq](a: T, b: T) -> Bool {
  a == b                                            //~ E0401
}
